{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼べにいもちゃんと／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝更新してみる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日学校で無性に苔の魅力を\n誰かに伝えたくて先生に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「あの！苔ってどこに\n売ってますかね？！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生「...は？...コケ？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「苔、育てたいんですよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生「どうしたの。悩みでもあるの？\n悩みがあるんなら先生聞くよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って違あああああ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一向に話が進まない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ので近くにいた友達に\nなんとなく苔について話してみた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドン引きされた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後\n「屋久島～」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってぼやいたら\n更にドン引きされた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺中学生なんだけど、親に\n「自分は乃木坂46のファンだ」\nって言うべきだと思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか言えるもん\nじゃないのかな？\n私はそういうのにもともと\n興味なかったから特になかったけど...\nあなたのお父さんお母さんにも\n乃木坂46のこと知ってほしいな\nって思います^^！\n隠すことないと思うよ！\nファンになってくれて\nありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校と乃木坂どっちが好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強嫌だけど、友達が好きです。\n乃木坂は私にとってもう一つの家\nみたいなもんです。\nお仕事もだいすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからどっちも大事だね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のときに誕プレって\nインフォメーションに\n持って行けばいいのかな？\n名前とかどうすればいいのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インフォメーションに\nお願いします。\n名前も箱などに書いてくださったら\nすぐわかると思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。\nめっちゃ嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはおやつじゃないけど、\nついついおやつに食べちゃう\nっていうような食べ物ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズとかナッツとか海苔とか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違う人推しててもまりかが\n最近気になっております\nどうすればいいのー？（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照れちゃう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になるだけじゃなく\nすきになってもらえるように\n頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか以外で童顔の\nメンバーといえば誰ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりん、生駒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンリオのキャラクターで\n好きなのなに？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はあんまりキャラクターものに\nはまってないなあ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのヘッドホンはどこのブランド？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"beats by dr.dreです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貝やキノコを食べるように\nなりましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだダメなのー泣\nきのこは我慢できるようになった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真のまりっかかわいすぎて\n推しメンにしたくなっちゃった\nんだけどこんな理由でもいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは！嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいく撮れるように\nもっと勉強する！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校で寝ない方法教えて！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵を描くと想像力で頭使うから\n眠たくならないよー！\nでも授業も聞こうねー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際私も眠くなったら\nお絵描きしてる...\nはい授業聞きますごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼント届きました。\nメリークリスマス！\nハッピーニューイヤー！\n本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういや昨日は物作りしてたんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネックレス作ってました。\nもうすぐ完成しそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーミシン自由に使えるように\nなりたいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一回教えてもらおうっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふへへ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいろいろ買いに行きたいなあ\n100均行きたいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日着てる服、\n私、寒色系です！\nって感じだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/7334023/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、今日も頑張りまりか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}